  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/667/667-13.htm",
  "statuteText": "667:13 Paper. –\n\nThe ballots shall be printed on plain paper in weight not less than that of ordinary printing paper. The secretary of state shall determine the color of the paper."
